      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAX EFFORT (2) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (25.40) at this track over 450m. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Can go on with it. ATTICA BLUE (1) goes very well this trip starting seven times for four wins and two minors. Was out of placings last time (30.24) at Sandown in a Grade 5 H, finishing fifth and beaten 8 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. PAW URLA (8) is worth forgiving last start after finishing fourth (24.08) at Bendigo over 425m. Cannot be left out. JACQUI MOSS (3) will have admirers after placing last time out.",
